1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,750
Outspoken is open. Every file lives in one public repository.

2
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:10,250
The site, the design system, the research and the films sit side by side, so anyone can see how the work is made.

3
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:16,250
Fifteen agent skills passed a security scan before we used them. Thirteen did not. Five more were written for this project.

4
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:21,450
The stack is open too: React, Vite, Storybook, HyperFrames, Vercel and Neon.

5
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:28,450
We studied two hundred and seventy-nine LinkedIn posts from sixty-one accounts, scored thirty logo concepts, and kept one clear mark.

6
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:34,250
Then we measured: accessibility one hundred, a hundred tests, and a deployment verified by hash.

